{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"short, tall\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"man, woman\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"blonde, brunette\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"man, woman\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thin, heavyset\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"man, woman\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"brown, blue, green\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eyes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"blond, brown, black, gray\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hair\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"long, short\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beard\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The tall woman is in the office."}, {"type": "example", "content": "He's a short man."}, {"type": "example", "content": "He's a heavyset man with a beard. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular. <br/> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied</span>.<br/> Irregular verbs change in different ways.<br/> For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did</span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask\u2026?</span> <br/> <span class=\"italic\">Did</span> is the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to ask\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"asked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to copy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"copied\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to surround\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"surrounded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to protect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"protected\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was, were\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to make\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"made\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to think\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thought\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Last week, I had a problem with a colleague."}, {"type": "example", "content": "He asked me to write a report. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I didn't get any help from anyone, so I just made something up.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He didn't like it very much."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "colleague"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person you work with"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Last week I had a problem with a colleague. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you describe people or talk about work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "heavyset"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who has a large size around the waist"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He's a short, heavyset man with a beard. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "beard"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "hair grown on the chin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My colleague has a beard. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to cause "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to result in some change"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I caused another problem at work."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "office"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the place where a person works"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There's a problem in the office."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "document"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "information printed on paper or on an electronic file "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She asked me to revise a document."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to make up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to invent "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I didn't know the answer, so I just made something up. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pet peeve"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that bothers or annoys you"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That's my pet peeve."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob02aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of your pet peeves (things that happen that you don't like) at work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write them on a list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask 3 other people about their pet peeves. Add their ideas to the list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Select the top 5 pet peeves shared by people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your list to your classmates."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a list of my pet peeves."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk to 3 other people about pet peeves."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a list of 5 top pet peeves."}]}], "type": "sena"}